# NAME: Parsec P2P
# AUTHOR: Horatio Xu
# FORMAT: Surge Remote Rule Set
# VERSION: 1.0.0
# UPDATED: 2026-10-08
# ASSIGN POLICY: DIRECT
# Put before Parsec proxy rule set.
# PROCESS-NAME parsecd works for Surge Mac; SRC-PORT 9000 fallback requires Mac client port 9000.
# Rule matching does not guarantee P2P can traverse NAT/firewalls.

DOMAIN,stun.parsec.app
DOMAIN,stun6.parsec.app
AND,((PROCESS-NAME,parsecd),(PROTOCOL,UDP))
AND,((SRC-PORT,9000),(PROTOCOL,UDP))
